 "descripcion": "The Monkey King realizes death will still come for him, crosses a stormy ocean on a pine raft, and solves Master Subodhi's secret midnight riddle.\n\n> Part 3: {when_next}.\nWould you have understood the three strikes on the head?\n\nFrom Journey to the West (Xiyouji), Wu Cheng'en, 16th century, chapters 1 and 2.\n#monkeyking #sunwukong #journeytothewest #mythology #shorts",
 "visual": "3d",
 "lineas": [
  {
   "texto": "In the middle of a royal feast, the Monkey King burst into *tears*.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "One day, old age and *Yama*, Lord of Death, would drag him underground.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "A king who cannot beat death owns *nothing*.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "At dawn, he tied pine logs and sailed into black *storm waves*.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "In human cities, he stole clothes and walked through terrified crowds.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Nobody on the streets wanted eternal life; they only chased *gold*.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "At last, a woodcutter pointed him up to Master *Subodhi*.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "The master named him *Sun Wukong*, Awakened to Emptiness.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "For seven years, Wukong swept stone floors and waited.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "When he refused every spell that could not beat *death*, Subodhi snapped.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "He struck Wukong's head *three times* and shut the back door.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Wukong grinned: three strikes meant the *third night watch*.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "In ancient China, the third watch was *midnight*, between eleven and one.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "At midnight, he slipped in and learned the *Seventy-Two Transformations*.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "One cloud-jump carried him *one hundred and eight thousand li*.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "When he turned into a pine tree to show off, Subodhi *banished* him.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Back home, a demon in black iron had *slaughtered* his monkeys.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Wukong needed a weapon. Part three, {when_next}.",
   "pausa": 0.3
  }
 ],
